1
00:00:04,884 --> 00:00:07,554
<c.simplifiedchinese>秘剑 飞饭纲！</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:11,188 --> 00:00:13,107
<c.simplifiedchinese>该说是幸运还是不幸呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:13,192 --> 00:00:17,155
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心的右臂承受了一些伤害
减轻了一些威力</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:17,242 --> 00:00:19,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的胳膊没有被完全切断</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:19,748 --> 00:00:24,085
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这孩子再也不能练习剑术了</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:24,799 --> 00:00:26,176
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么会…</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:30,393 --> 00:00:32,520
<c.simplifiedchinese>开什么玩笑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:32,607 --> 00:00:34,942
<c.simplifiedchinese>他为了剑术赌上了一切！</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:35,028 --> 00:00:36,488
<c.simplifiedchinese>还那么有天赋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:36,573 --> 00:00:39,201
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么要承受这些？</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:39,286 --> 00:00:40,871
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不是大夫吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:40,956 --> 00:00:42,917
<c.simplifiedchinese>快做点什么啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:44,004 --> 00:00:46,256
<c.simplifiedchinese>做不到的事就是做不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:00:48,931 --> 00:00:50,849
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起 弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:00:50,935 --> 00:00:52,186
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然很遗憾</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:00:52,772 --> 00:00:54,899
<c.simplifiedchinese>但医生也不是万能的</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:01:04,086 --> 00:01:08,674
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:37,355 --> 00:02:38,898
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:38,984 --> 00:02:40,068
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:40,946 --> 00:02:42,573
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的右臂动不了了</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:02:43,701 --> 00:02:45,619
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然这不是在做梦…</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:49,127
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父…</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:02:49,964 --> 00:02:51,090
<c.simplifiedchinese>他背叛了我</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:02:55,516 --> 00:02:57,393
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村已经走了</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:03:00,568 --> 00:03:01,486
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们也去</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:02,865 --> 00:03:03,699
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:03,783 --> 00:03:05,659
<c.simplifiedchinese>他还不能乱动</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:05,745 --> 00:03:07,747
<c.simplifiedchinese>需要静养</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:07,832 --> 00:03:08,708
<c.simplifiedchinese>不</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:08,793 --> 00:03:10,503
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们要去见证他们之间的了结</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:11,090 --> 00:03:12,966
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你现在不亲眼见证</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:13,052 --> 00:03:14,470
<c.simplifiedchinese>是没法振作起来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:19,147 --> 00:03:21,399
<c.simplifiedchinese>真拿他们没办法</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:21,986 --> 00:03:25,698
<c.simplifiedchinese>好好看着他们 别让他们乱来</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:25,785 --> 00:03:26,911
<c.simplifiedchinese>好</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:32,841 --> 00:03:33,842
<c.simplifiedchinese>好慢</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:34,594 --> 00:03:36,930
<c.simplifiedchinese>一刻钟早就过去了</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:37,851 --> 00:03:41,771
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个男人一定是害怕吾辈的秘剑
所以逃跑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,403
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:44,114 --> 00:03:47,868
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这种对手他有什么必要逃跑？</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:47,955 --> 00:03:48,873
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:03:48,957 --> 00:03:50,041
<c.simplifiedchinese>或者说</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:03:50,126 --> 00:03:53,337
<c.simplifiedchinese>也许你才是找借口想食言的那个</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:03:53,424 --> 00:03:55,468
<c.simplifiedchinese>你想溜走的话 我不会阻止你</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:03:55,553 --> 00:03:57,805
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟对手是剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:03:59,352 --> 00:04:02,564
<c.simplifiedchinese>有机会溜走就应该抓住机会啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:03,152 --> 00:04:05,821
<c.simplifiedchinese>说话注意点 小子</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:05,907 --> 00:04:09,577
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈不介意跟你玩玩打发时间</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:10,166 --> 00:04:12,418
<c.simplifiedchinese>我倒是不介意</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:12,504 --> 00:04:13,755
<c.simplifiedchinese>可是</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:13,839 --> 00:04:15,674
<c.simplifiedchinese>输给剑客另当别论</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:16,261 --> 00:04:20,516
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你输给一个打手 那可就完了</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:31,416 --> 00:04:33,377
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来我们俩运气不好</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:33,462 --> 00:04:36,090
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要被打得哭哭啼啼地回家了</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:38,305 --> 00:04:40,641
<c.simplifiedchinese>真正的战斗开始了</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:43,315 --> 00:04:45,818
<c.simplifiedchinese>这次希望你认真和吾辈打一场</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:45,903 --> 00:04:50,992
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈要打败你
开创属于真古流的新时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:54,421 --> 00:05:01,344
<c.simplifiedchinese>所谓“饭纲”的招式
实际上是劈开空气产生真空波</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:01,435 --> 00:05:04,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是被称为“镰鼬”的自然现象</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:04,316 --> 00:05:06,651
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦 你注意到了</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:06,737 --> 00:05:10,073
<c.simplifiedchinese>伤口很宽 但是出血却很少</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:10,161 --> 00:05:13,039
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是镰鼬造成的伤口的典型特征</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:13,125 --> 00:05:17,004
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算你看穿饭纲的本质
也改变不了它的强大</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:18,594 --> 00:05:21,639
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下一瞬间能看到
你劈过的地方发生变形</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:21,725 --> 00:05:23,977
<c.simplifiedchinese>和夏天的灼热雾气一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:24,564 --> 00:05:27,859
<c.simplifiedchinese>都是由瞬间产生的空气浓度差造成的</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:30,284 --> 00:05:32,078
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是破解你招式的线索</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:32,789 --> 00:05:35,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>之前是在下大意才没发现</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:36,045 --> 00:05:39,757
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么至少 在下现在要打败饭纲</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:39,844 --> 00:05:41,137
<c.simplifiedchinese>可笑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:42,308 --> 00:05:44,936
<c.simplifiedchinese>只有三流剑客
才会被曾见识过一次的剑招</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:45,021 --> 00:05:46,689
<c.simplifiedchinese>再次打到</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:46,775 --> 00:05:50,028
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心怎么可能被打到？</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:50,616 --> 00:05:56,038
<c.simplifiedchinese>秘剑飞饭纲虽然十分锐利 无法阻挡</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:56,127 --> 00:05:59,588
<c.simplifiedchinese>但对于能读出弹道
并躲开子弹的超一流剑客来说</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:59,676 --> 00:06:01,886
<c.simplifiedchinese>躲开这招并非不可能</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:02,515 --> 00:06:04,392
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就尝尝这招！</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:06,189 --> 00:06:07,607
<c.simplifiedchinese>连发的飞饭纲？</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:21,010 --> 00:06:23,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>看到了吧？这就是饭纲！</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:24,016 --> 00:06:25,809
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吾辈从古流剑术秘籍上看到</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:25,895 --> 00:06:29,398
<c.simplifiedchinese>又花了十年岁月领悟的秘剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:29,486 --> 00:06:32,238
<c.simplifiedchinese>哪里那么容易破解？</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:32,325 --> 00:06:34,952
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是真古流的象征</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:35,038 --> 00:06:38,291
<c.simplifiedchinese>终极杀人剑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:38,837 --> 00:06:39,922
<c.simplifiedchinese>你很开心吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:42,219 --> 00:06:43,053
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:43,889 --> 00:06:48,393
<c.simplifiedchinese>这点小擦伤就让你这么开心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:49,275 --> 00:06:51,486
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:52,072 --> 00:06:55,158
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在在下确定了 雷十太</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:55,245 --> 00:06:56,871
<c.simplifiedchinese>确定了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:56,957 --> 00:06:57,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>确定什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:58,752 --> 00:07:05,175
<c.simplifiedchinese>你一直宣扬杀人剑 却从没杀过人</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:07:06,726 --> 00:07:10,564
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀过人的真正的刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:10,651 --> 00:07:14,572
<c.simplifiedchinese>不会在打倒对手前
就对自己的剑招如此洋洋得意</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:15,744 --> 00:07:21,375
<c.simplifiedchinese>你根本不知道手持刽子手之剑的人
陷入了多深的地狱</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:21,464 --> 00:07:28,179
<c.simplifiedchinese>而你那浅薄又傲慢的剑
夺走了由太郎修习剑术的机会</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:30,608 --> 00:07:33,319
<c.simplifiedchinese>做好付出相应代价的觉悟吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:35,951 --> 00:07:38,704
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈不会再容忍你的任何嘲弄</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:38,790 --> 00:07:39,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:45,429 --> 00:07:48,349
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:48,435 --> 00:07:51,813
<c.simplifiedchinese>用缠饭纲和飞饭纲进行联合攻击</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:52,860 --> 00:07:56,948
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心在攻击范围内时用缠饭纲
不给剑心攻击的间隙</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:57,035 --> 00:08:00,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>当剑心在范围外时
就使用飞饭纲来造成致命伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:08:00,501 --> 00:08:03,212
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为没法回击或阻挡饭纲</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:08:03,297 --> 00:08:05,508
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心只能不断闪躲</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:08:05,594 --> 00:08:08,013
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且他的右臂负伤了</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:08:08,099 --> 00:08:12,311
<c.simplifiedchinese>只用左手 剑心的龙槌闪威力会减半</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:15,152
<c.simplifiedchinese>也不能使用他最擅长的拔刀术</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:08:15,238 --> 00:08:18,282
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样一直处于被动可不妙</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:18,369 --> 00:08:19,495
<c.simplifiedchinese>看穿了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:19,580 --> 00:08:20,873
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是那里！</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:21,375 --> 00:08:22,501
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:23,547 --> 00:08:25,549
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈赢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:25,634 --> 00:08:30,347
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管你速度多快
腿受伤了可没法自由行动</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:30,978 --> 00:08:32,354
<c.simplifiedchinese>都说了一点小擦伤而已</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:34,483
<c.simplifiedchinese>别每次都这么开心啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:34,569 --> 00:08:35,903
<c.simplifiedchinese>可笑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:35,988 --> 00:08:40,367
<c.simplifiedchinese>你尽可能说大话吧
但这种距离你是没法反击的</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:40,456 --> 00:08:45,085
<c.simplifiedchinese>除非你像吾辈一样能用出飞饭纲</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:45,173 --> 00:08:47,258
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞饭纲…</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:47,343 --> 00:08:48,928
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下用不出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:49,014 --> 00:08:50,766
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:50,851 --> 00:08:53,062
<c.simplifiedchinese>真古流才是至高</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:53,147 --> 00:08:56,025
<c.simplifiedchinese>饭纲才是最强</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:56,111 --> 00:08:56,987
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:57,072 --> 00:09:00,950
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过在攻击范围外攻击
在下也做得到！</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:07,300 --> 00:09:09,511
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞天御剑流拔刀术！</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:10,098 --> 00:09:11,057
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞龙闪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:53,017 --> 00:09:53,893
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:10:01,993 --> 00:10:02,994
<c.simplifiedchinese>别乱动</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:10:03,622 --> 00:10:05,874
<c.simplifiedchinese>敢乱动 吾辈就杀了这个小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:10:08,339 --> 00:10:11,217
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈说要杀了他</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:10:11,303 --> 00:10:13,722
<c.simplifiedchinese>放下你的刀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:10:13,808 --> 00:10:15,227
<c.simplifiedchinese>你杀啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:10:15,812 --> 00:10:17,940
<c.simplifiedchinese>你能下得了手就杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:10:18,025 --> 00:10:21,695
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就算是死 也不会向你屈服的</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:10:23,244 --> 00:10:25,829
<c.simplifiedchinese>他自己都这么说了</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:10:25,916 --> 00:10:27,292
<c.simplifiedchinese>你动手啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:10:28,003 --> 00:10:30,589
<c.simplifiedchinese>真古流不是杀人剑吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:36,017
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么“用真剑” 什么“古流”</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:36,103 --> 00:10:39,398
<c.simplifiedchinese>这些都不一定是杀人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:39,986 --> 00:10:44,365
<c.simplifiedchinese>因夺走他人生命
而沉重到让自己坠入地狱深渊的</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:44,452 --> 00:10:46,121
<c.simplifiedchinese>才是杀人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:47,292 --> 00:10:50,586
<c.simplifiedchinese>你没杀过人</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:50,674 --> 00:10:55,721
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的真古流可以斩人 但却没法杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:56,811 --> 00:11:02,984
<c.simplifiedchinese>放下剑吧
在碰上真正的杀人剑被夺去性命前</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:11:30,879 --> 00:11:31,713
<c.simplifiedchinese>走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:11:34,677 --> 00:11:35,804
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们走</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:11:47,495 --> 00:11:48,663
<c.simplifiedchinese>永别了</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:11:49,290 --> 00:11:50,291
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:12:06,116 --> 00:12:10,453
<c.simplifiedchinese>辛苦你们特意过来
但少爷说他不想见任何人</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:12:11,084 --> 00:12:12,794
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:14,548
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 这是慰问品</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:12:14,632 --> 00:12:16,050
<c.simplifiedchinese>多谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:12:16,803 --> 00:12:19,389
<c.simplifiedchinese>过一段时间我们会再来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:12:19,977 --> 00:12:21,687
<c.simplifiedchinese>非常感谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:12:22,858 --> 00:12:25,110
<c.simplifiedchinese>请一定再来</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:12:27,491 --> 00:12:29,702
<c.simplifiedchinese>他把自己关起来也情有可原</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:12:29,787 --> 00:12:36,502
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟他被自己视为理想的师父背叛了
而且不能再练习剑术了</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:12:37,094 --> 00:12:39,931
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然神谷活心流是救人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:12:40,017 --> 00:12:42,478
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这次该怎么办才好？</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:12:42,563 --> 00:12:44,106
<c.simplifiedchinese>太无力了</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:12:44,192 --> 00:12:46,486
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想不到任何一句能安慰他的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:10,994
<c.simplifiedchinese>回想过去</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:13:11,579 --> 00:13:14,666
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治维新之后 生活发生了剧变</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:13:14,752 --> 00:13:18,172
<c.simplifiedchinese>我一个没有任何门路的下层武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:13:18,260 --> 00:13:23,140
<c.simplifiedchinese>只凭着会挑刀剑的好眼光
成了刀剑商人</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:13:23,228 --> 00:13:29,609
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且在外国大获成功
赚取了如此多的财富</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:37,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>在许多士族没落的时代
我的人生乍一看很成功吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:13:37,715 --> 00:13:42,094
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是换一个角度看
也可以说是败犬的一生</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:13:42,183 --> 00:13:46,771
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了养活、保护家人</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:13:46,858 --> 00:13:53,698
<c.simplifiedchinese>向过去所说的夷狄谄媚讨好
卖出作为武士之魂的刀剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:13:54,374 --> 00:14:00,296
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以由太郎才不想像我这样活着吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:14:01,054 --> 00:14:02,931
<c.simplifiedchinese>然而</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:14:04,227 --> 00:14:09,899
<c.simplifiedchinese>我却被石动雷十太的表面实力骗了</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:14:12,993 --> 00:14:14,161
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在这啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:14:14,664 --> 00:14:16,541
<c.simplifiedchinese>来得好快啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:14:17,211 --> 00:14:18,671
<c.simplifiedchinese>由左卫门先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:14:18,755 --> 00:14:23,677
<c.simplifiedchinese>今天我们就聊到这里
在下告辞 改日再来探望</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:14:24,267 --> 00:14:26,269
<c.simplifiedchinese>多谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:14:26,354 --> 00:14:29,524
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过下次可能是你最后一次见到我了</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:14:30,612 --> 00:14:32,906
<c.simplifiedchinese>我考虑了很多</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:14:32,992 --> 00:14:38,372
<c.simplifiedchinese>决定把由太郎带去德国</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:14:38,462 --> 00:14:39,713
<c.simplifiedchinese>-德国？
-德国？</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:14:40,883 --> 00:14:45,304
<c.simplifiedchinese>德国是现在世界上医学最先进的国家</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:14:45,392 --> 00:14:50,397
<c.simplifiedchinese>在德国接受治疗或许可以治好他</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:14:50,486 --> 00:14:57,034
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且如果住在国外
由太郎应该也能忘掉剑术吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:14:58,418 --> 00:15:00,837
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们一周后出发</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:15:00,923 --> 00:15:03,884
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么时候回国就不知道了</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:15:08,396 --> 00:15:11,733
<c.simplifiedchinese>（新桥站）</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:15:15,034 --> 00:15:18,204
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的很感谢你们的关照</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:15:18,291 --> 00:15:19,960
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:15:20,044 --> 00:15:22,171
<c.simplifiedchinese>做个最后的告别吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:15:25,430 --> 00:15:26,640
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎…</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:15:27,935 --> 00:15:31,605
<c.simplifiedchinese>我果然还是说不出任何安慰的话来</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:15:32,194 --> 00:15:37,074
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算鼓励他让他加油
也没法减轻他的痛苦</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:15:40,627 --> 00:15:43,630
<c.simplifiedchinese>老爷 出发时间快到了</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:15:43,717 --> 00:15:45,093
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道了</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:15:45,846 --> 00:15:46,972
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就告辞了</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:16:01,377 --> 00:16:02,462
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎！</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:16:08,140 --> 00:16:09,391
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:16:09,477 --> 00:16:13,397
<c.simplifiedchinese>你准备这样一直消沉下去吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:16:14,946 --> 00:16:18,282
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果雷十太的背叛让你那么痛苦</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:16:18,370 --> 00:16:22,248
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就变得比雷十太更强大
来消除痛苦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:16:22,336 --> 00:16:26,590
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是那个被剑心打倒的雷十太</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:16:26,678 --> 00:16:31,265
<c.simplifiedchinese>而是那个你理想中的雷十太！</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:16:31,354 --> 00:16:35,274
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你做不到
那你一辈子都只是一条败犬！</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:16:37,073 --> 00:16:38,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:16:40,831 --> 00:16:43,083
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭上嘴听我说</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:16:43,168 --> 00:16:45,295
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说谁是败犬？</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:16:45,382 --> 00:16:46,466
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:16:46,551 --> 00:16:48,553
<c.simplifiedchinese>我绝对不会放弃剑术！</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:16:49,305 --> 00:16:50,765
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝对不会！</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:16:50,851 --> 00:16:54,646
<c.simplifiedchinese>右手不行 那我就用左手</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:16:54,734 --> 00:16:58,738
<c.simplifiedchinese>只用我的左手就足够打败你了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:16:58,825 --> 00:17:02,620
<c.simplifiedchinese>少说大话 你个猫眼懦夫！</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:17:02,708 --> 00:17:05,335
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴 你个乖僻的臭小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:17:08,302 --> 00:17:09,553
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:17:10,264 --> 00:17:11,557
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:17:12,603 --> 00:17:13,687
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:17:17,278 --> 00:17:19,322
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用担心了</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:17:23,207 --> 00:17:25,292
<c.simplifiedchinese>听着 可别忘了</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:17:25,377 --> 00:17:28,089
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们的胜负还没了结</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:17:28,175 --> 00:17:30,177
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定要回来啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:17:30,262 --> 00:17:34,850
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流第二弟子的位子
我会给你留着 等你回来</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:17:47,756 --> 00:17:49,675
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是一群善良的人啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:17:50,344 --> 00:17:51,470
<c.simplifiedchinese>那家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:17:51,556 --> 00:17:55,560
<c.simplifiedchinese>对受伤的人也不手下留情</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:17:59,279 --> 00:18:00,572
<c.simplifiedchinese>明神弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:18:01,366 --> 00:18:03,618
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会回来打倒你</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:18:06,001 --> 00:18:09,337
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 好不容易来一次新桥</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:18:09,424 --> 00:18:10,967
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们去吃点西餐吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:18:11,052 --> 00:18:13,180
<c.simplifiedchinese>又准备让我请客吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:18:14,810 --> 00:18:17,938
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 你的表情怎么这么严肃？</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:18:18,860 --> 00:18:19,694
<c.simplifiedchinese>没什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:18:20,362 --> 00:18:23,157
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下只是在想石动雷十太的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:18:23,786 --> 00:18:25,705
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是个讨厌的家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:18:25,790 --> 00:18:30,045
<c.simplifiedchinese>但缠饭纲和飞饭纲这两招确实很厉害</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:18:30,592 --> 00:18:32,427
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的确有剑术方面的天赋</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:18:33,096 --> 00:18:35,807
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过也因为这天赋</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:18:35,894 --> 00:18:41,149
<c.simplifiedchinese>他没有寻求剑术的本质
一味追求剑术技巧</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:18:42,281 --> 00:18:45,618
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果不是那么执着于真古流和杀人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:18:45,705 --> 00:18:50,043
<c.simplifiedchinese>在明治时代
也许他真的可以开创新的剑术</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:18:51,424 --> 00:18:53,009
<c.simplifiedchinese>希望有一天他会明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:18:53,596 --> 00:18:59,310
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有越过杀人这一底线是多么的幸运</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:19:01,862 --> 00:19:04,323
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 你们在干嘛呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:19:04,409 --> 00:19:05,410
<c.simplifiedchinese>快走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:19:07,874 --> 00:19:13,505
<c.simplifiedchinese>以前在下跟中越流的前川师父
探讨过剑术的未来</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:19:14,220 --> 00:19:16,973
<c.simplifiedchinese>当时他很悲观</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:19:18,228 --> 00:19:24,443
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是看到弥彦和由太郎他们
似乎不用担心啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:19:31,922 --> 00:19:32,840
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:19:32,924 --> 00:19:33,800
<c.simplifiedchinese>（神谷薰）</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:19:33,885 --> 00:19:35,011
<c.simplifiedchinese>（门生 明神弥彦
预定 塚山由太郎）</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:21:16,924 --> 00:21:18,551
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:21:18,635 --> 00:21:19,970
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管是谁</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:21:20,055 --> 00:21:20,973
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:21:29,657 --> 00:21:32,118
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么“用真剑” 什么“古流”</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:21:32,204 --> 00:21:35,457
<c.simplifiedchinese>这些都不一定是杀人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:21:36,170 --> 00:21:40,508
<c.simplifiedchinese>因夺走他人生命
而沉重到让自己坠入地狱深渊的</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:21:41,472 --> 00:21:43,224
<c.simplifiedchinese>才是杀人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:22:04,185 --> 00:22:06,187
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 这是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:22:47,981 --> 00:22:50,817
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《左之助与锦绘》</c.simplifiedchinese>

